# Render static-site SPA fallback.
#
# The dashboard uses BrowserRouter, so /dashboard/jobs is a client-side route
# with no file behind it. Without this rule the static host answers a direct
# load or a refresh with its own plain-text "Not Found" — which is exactly what
# the deployed site was doing.
#
# 200 rather than a redirect: the URL the user typed has to stay in the address
# bar for React Router to read it.
/*  /index.html  200
